WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:12.660
'Sup, guys?

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.100
Wait a minute...

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.380
You guys aren't the real Avengers! 
I can tell, Hulk gives it away.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:25.720
That was awesome!

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:35.360
Did Liz get a new top?

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:36.320
No. We've seen that before.

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:38.040
Never with that skirt.

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:41.140
We should probably stop staring before it gets creepy though.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:42.740
Yeah.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.080
Too late.

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:45.880
You guys are losers.

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:51.840
So, to become an Avenger, are there like trials or an interview?

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.900
Just don't do anything I would do

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:55.920
and definitely don't do anything I wouldn't do.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.720
There's a little gray area in there and that's where you operate.

00:00:58.720 --> 00:00:59.380
Oh.

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:00.300
All right?

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.040
That's not a hug, I'm just grabbing the door for you.

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:03.860
Alright, kid, good luck out there.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.140
Listen, I know school sucks.

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:11.620
Peter! You still with us? 
- Uh, yeah, yeah.

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:13.220
I know you want to save the world.

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:14.560
But...

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:17.120
You're not ready yet.

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:20.360
You're the Spiderman.

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:21.680
No, I'm not. I'm not.

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:22.780
This is just a costume! This is...

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:24.080
You were on the ceiling!

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:26.900
Stay close to the ground.

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:30.280
And stay out of trouble.

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:37.980
Forget the flying monster guy. 
There are people who handle this sort of thing.

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:40.040
I'm sick of him treating me like a kid all the time.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:41.020
But you are a kid.

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:43.340
This is my chance to prove myself.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:46.700
Peter, what is going on with you?!

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:49.680
I'm really sorry, I'm so busy, I'm slammed.

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:53.020
Don't mess with me, because I will kill you

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.620
and everybody you love.

